WEBVTT

00:30.940 --> 00:33.250
[You Have My Heart]

00:33.290 --> 00:36.250
[Episode 8: Now I Know Your Heart]

00:49.350 --> 00:50.000
My Lady.

00:50.710 --> 00:53.040
Thank you for helping me regain my senses.

00:53.520 --> 00:55.050
Here in Yin-Yang Crossing,

00:55.700 --> 00:58.030
there aren't many people who would show me

00:58.590 --> 00:59.450
such kindness.

01:08.760 --> 01:10.200
Once my mind cleared,

01:10.650 --> 01:12.050
I remembered something.

01:14.950 --> 01:16.230
That day in prison,

01:16.750 --> 01:18.360
an elder told me

01:19.230 --> 01:20.230
that if

01:21.630 --> 01:23.789
I could obtain Magistrate Bai's heart,

01:23.789 --> 01:26.520
I would possess
the greatest beauty in the world.

01:27.240 --> 01:29.160
But at the time, I was so exhausted

01:29.770 --> 01:30.900
that I couldn't tell

01:31.180 --> 01:32.250
whether it was real

01:32.740 --> 01:33.660
or just a dream.

01:37.539 --> 01:39.900
Do you remember what he looks like?

01:46.100 --> 01:48.770
At first, he spoke with his back to me.

01:49.580 --> 01:51.240
Then he slowly turned around.

02:02.110 --> 02:04.080
It's that one-eyed old man again!

02:07.050 --> 02:08.060
You should say,

02:08.680 --> 02:09.740
it's Bai Han again.

02:10.180 --> 02:11.310
Have you forgotten?

02:11.700 --> 02:13.360
This is just Bai Han's vessel.

02:13.740 --> 02:16.490
And he has more than just one vessel.

02:18.700 --> 02:19.500
You're right.

02:20.030 --> 02:21.490
There's also Bai Shanjun.

02:23.700 --> 02:25.370
Anyway, I just want to know

02:25.610 --> 02:26.460
how to retrieve the other half

02:26.460 --> 02:28.060
of the tree heart inside him.

02:29.340 --> 02:30.610
Bai Han's cultivation is strong,

02:30.610 --> 02:32.010
and he's far too cunning.

02:32.770 --> 02:34.100
Without the tree heart,

02:34.140 --> 02:36.270
how can we possibly stand against him?

02:37.700 --> 02:39.050
Born of evil power,

02:39.470 --> 02:40.680
and nourished by it.

02:41.460 --> 02:44.260
As long as evil power surges
in Yin-Yang Crossing,

02:44.920 --> 02:47.710
he can continue absorbing it
to heal himself

02:47.960 --> 02:49.290
and grow even stronger.

02:51.050 --> 02:51.860
Don't worry.

02:52.770 --> 02:55.300
It's fine if we can't
retrieve the tree heart.

02:55.360 --> 02:58.020
We'll simply use
the county magistrate as bait.

02:58.930 --> 03:00.130
We can't keep letting

03:00.360 --> 03:02.840
Bai Han lead us around by the nose.

03:10.180 --> 03:17.190
[Dedication Above Self]

03:14.920 --> 03:17.030
Greetings, My Lord!

03:17.770 --> 03:19.210
What are you doing?

03:19.980 --> 03:23.650
Lord Bai, we treated you poorly
at Huichun Brothel the other day.

03:23.860 --> 03:25.530
I've felt guilty ever since.

03:26.020 --> 03:28.880
I came here today specifically
to offer my apology.

03:28.930 --> 03:29.390
Well...

03:29.610 --> 03:31.210
Lord Bai is wise and upright,

03:31.230 --> 03:32.430
clean as still water,

03:32.440 --> 03:33.900
and impartial as a mirror.

03:34.000 --> 03:35.480
My deepest gratitude to you, Lord Bai.

03:35.480 --> 03:35.930
Please, get up.

03:35.930 --> 03:36.790
Thank you both.

03:37.020 --> 03:38.550
Guys, bring these stuff in.

03:38.610 --> 03:39.140
Yes, sir!

03:40.579 --> 03:41.110
Lord Bai.

03:41.460 --> 03:42.340
Not bad.

03:44.370 --> 03:44.970
Thank you.

03:45.270 --> 03:46.390
You're welcome.

03:47.090 --> 03:47.740
My Lord.

03:48.300 --> 03:49.530
Our Yin-Yang Crossing

03:49.530 --> 03:51.790
hasn't had a useful magistrate in years.

03:52.050 --> 03:52.770
Back then,

03:52.800 --> 03:54.100
Xiqianhua took care of us,

03:54.100 --> 03:55.620
so we didn't feel much difference.

03:55.620 --> 03:57.810
But ever since you arrived,
things have become even better.

03:57.810 --> 03:58.579
Now,

03:58.700 --> 04:01.210
many families don't even bother
locking their doors when they go out.

04:01.210 --> 04:02.420
If someone finds money on the road,

04:02.420 --> 04:04.210
they'll bring it straight
to the magistrate's office.

04:04.210 --> 04:05.740
All of this is thanks to you.

04:06.090 --> 04:06.930
Besides,

04:07.370 --> 04:08.580
Lady Fufeng's standards

04:08.580 --> 04:10.220
have always been incredibly high.

04:10.220 --> 04:11.680
Since she approves of you,

04:11.770 --> 04:12.530
we naturally

04:12.530 --> 04:14.860
trust you as well.

04:15.140 --> 04:17.529
Lady Fufeng approves of me?

04:17.899 --> 04:19.140
Of course.

04:19.700 --> 04:20.899
I've never seen her

04:20.899 --> 04:22.830
pay this much attention to anyone.

04:27.840 --> 04:29.960
To be honest, this yamen

04:30.460 --> 04:32.940
hasn't been this lively in years.

04:34.080 --> 04:34.960
Back then,

04:36.020 --> 04:38.350
if Lady Fufeng hadn't guarded this place,

04:38.820 --> 04:41.080
it would have fallen into chaos long ago.

04:47.850 --> 04:51.450
When the sky fell, she was the one
at the front lines holding it up.

04:51.560 --> 04:54.690
When order collapsed,
she rebuilt it with her own hands.

04:55.250 --> 04:58.020
The peace Yin-Yang Crossing enjoys today,

04:58.460 --> 05:01.210
where humans and demons

05:01.210 --> 05:03.170
can live and make a living together,

05:03.170 --> 05:04.880
exists all because of her.

05:06.520 --> 05:09.570
She's the anchor of our Yin-Yang Crossing.

05:10.930 --> 05:13.490
And now that she stands behind you,

05:14.260 --> 05:15.330
we trust her,

05:15.670 --> 05:17.400
so naturally, we trust you too.

05:38.460 --> 05:39.630
Place your bets!

05:39.950 --> 05:40.900
Small.

05:40.920 --> 05:41.770
Big.

05:42.330 --> 05:43.290
I won again!

05:44.610 --> 05:48.870
Magic and sorcery are strictly forbidden
at the Golden Toad Gambling House.

05:48.870 --> 05:49.530
Move aside!

05:51.220 --> 05:52.080
They're yours.

06:00.720 --> 06:01.330
Thanks.

06:04.470 --> 06:05.590
What are you doing?

06:05.850 --> 06:06.650
Grandpa,

06:06.850 --> 06:09.140
why can't I ever
finish plucking your beard?

06:09.140 --> 06:10.090
Is that so?

06:23.730 --> 06:24.660
Magistrate Bai.

06:25.530 --> 06:26.620
Magistrate Bai.

06:28.970 --> 06:30.430
Do you want to play a round?

06:31.850 --> 06:33.500
No, you guys go ahead.

06:34.700 --> 06:35.650
Come on.

06:35.800 --> 06:36.870
Big or small,

06:36.890 --> 06:37.980
place your bets!

06:46.250 --> 06:48.340
[The Magistrate's Office]

07:00.910 --> 07:01.440
Master.

07:02.170 --> 07:03.940
Lately, petitions about theft

07:03.940 --> 07:04.820
and neighborhood disputes

07:04.820 --> 07:06.350
have decreased significantly.

07:06.350 --> 07:08.710
They're probably being reported
to the county yamen now.

07:08.710 --> 07:09.970
Looking at it this way,

07:10.460 --> 07:12.090
that bookworm county magistrate

07:12.090 --> 07:13.290
is quite capable.

07:14.770 --> 07:15.960
How many of today's petitions

07:15.960 --> 07:17.720
are related to evil power?

07:19.580 --> 07:22.650
Cases about panic, madness,
and beast attacks

07:22.890 --> 07:24.940
have increased 30 percent
compared to last month.

07:24.940 --> 07:26.600
The dead field in West Village

07:27.290 --> 07:28.420
is expanding again.

07:28.850 --> 07:31.110
If you've seen enough, just come inside.

07:41.450 --> 07:42.020
My Lady.

07:47.900 --> 07:49.300
Take a look if you want to.

07:50.530 --> 07:51.170
It's fine.

07:54.690 --> 07:55.490
My Lady.

07:55.790 --> 07:57.980
Do you need to review these every day?

07:59.170 --> 08:00.230
Of course she does!

08:00.730 --> 08:02.940
What kind of place
did you think the Xiqianhua Mansion was?

08:02.940 --> 08:05.200
A gathering den for demons and monsters?

08:06.330 --> 08:07.060
Lord Bai,

08:07.790 --> 08:08.990
it's not even 9 PM yet.

08:09.380 --> 08:11.820
Why are you here so early?

08:13.900 --> 08:15.900
My Lady, can we speak in private?

08:19.450 --> 08:19.910
My Lady.

08:20.600 --> 08:23.400
Today, Madam Chun and Wan
came to the county yamen.

08:23.900 --> 08:24.900
They talked a lot,

08:25.820 --> 08:26.900
and I heard

08:27.230 --> 08:28.910
many rumors about you.

08:30.500 --> 08:33.299
Don't take Madam Chun's words
too seriously.

08:34.320 --> 08:36.049
A thousand years is a long time.

08:36.789 --> 08:38.590
Even I can't remember most of it.

08:38.919 --> 08:41.590
But the people have the clearest memory.

08:42.690 --> 08:43.900
It's far more real

08:44.290 --> 08:45.820
than any official records.

08:47.860 --> 08:49.990
Lord Bai, did you hurry all the way here

08:51.080 --> 08:52.210
just to tell me this?

08:52.470 --> 08:53.280
Of course not.

08:54.100 --> 08:54.560
My Lady,

08:55.280 --> 08:57.610
I want to know the real Yin-Yang Crossing.

09:07.430 --> 09:08.620
Can this willow tree

09:10.440 --> 09:11.470
really connect to

09:11.490 --> 09:13.420
Yin-Yang Crossing's earth veins?

09:18.290 --> 09:18.890
Of course.

09:19.810 --> 09:20.270
My Lady,

09:21.960 --> 09:23.420
what kind of demon are you?

09:25.830 --> 09:26.560
A tree demon.

09:27.660 --> 09:28.390
A willow tree

09:29.140 --> 09:31.160
that spent 1,000 years
cultivating a human form.

09:31.160 --> 09:32.110
A willow tree?

09:39.670 --> 09:40.760
This spirit willow

09:41.510 --> 09:42.510
is my true form.

09:47.140 --> 09:48.200
I didn't know that.

09:52.170 --> 09:54.370
A willow tree can turn into a human form?

09:56.410 --> 09:58.410
No wonder the spiritual pool

09:58.740 --> 10:00.410
uses these willow leaves to channel water.

10:00.410 --> 10:02.380
It feels like an endless supply.

10:02.810 --> 10:04.290
This willow tree is so big.

10:12.140 --> 10:14.260
Lord Bai, you've improved a lot.

10:14.610 --> 10:16.210
Associating the willow tree

10:16.220 --> 10:17.530
with a spiritual pool,

10:18.410 --> 10:22.340
you're starting to look more like
a true citizen of Yin-Yang Crossing.

10:22.900 --> 10:23.450
My Lady,

10:25.450 --> 10:27.180
when you spoke of willingness,

10:27.840 --> 10:30.970
you wanted me to stay
in Yin-Yang Crossing of my own will,

10:31.020 --> 10:31.680
didn't you?

10:35.170 --> 10:36.900
I was born into a humble family.

10:36.920 --> 10:38.980
My original intention as an official

10:39.010 --> 10:40.470
was simply to help people.

10:40.960 --> 10:43.560
So I devoted myself to my duties,

10:45.100 --> 10:45.980
only to end up

10:45.980 --> 10:47.450
taking the blame and being demoted

10:47.450 --> 10:49.380
for a superior born into nobility.

10:49.690 --> 10:51.740
When I first arrived at Yin-Yang Crossing,

10:51.740 --> 10:53.740
I just let things take their course.

10:53.990 --> 10:55.080
But once I got here,

10:55.560 --> 10:56.870
everything I've seen

10:57.210 --> 10:59.670
has overturned everything I once believed.

11:00.220 --> 11:00.860
Lord Bai.

11:02.170 --> 11:03.700
Cut the bureaucratic tone.

11:04.140 --> 11:06.400
My Lady, this is not a bureaucratic tone.

11:07.310 --> 11:08.820
After arriving at Yin-Yang Crossing,

11:08.820 --> 11:10.720
for the first time, I truly feel that

11:10.720 --> 11:12.430
I'm doing something as an official.

11:12.430 --> 11:15.070
And all of this was
because of you, My Lady.

11:18.380 --> 11:19.140
It seems

11:19.630 --> 11:22.830
you've finally thought it through,
unyielding Lord Bai.

11:24.530 --> 11:25.290
But,

11:26.410 --> 11:27.620
I cannot blindly

11:28.260 --> 11:29.500
step into this world.

11:30.220 --> 11:30.790
My Lady.

11:31.500 --> 11:33.740
Please show me the real Yin-Yang Crossing.

11:33.740 --> 11:35.690
Show me what it is you're protecting,

11:35.690 --> 11:36.620
and why...

11:37.480 --> 11:38.480
it has to be me.

11:39.740 --> 11:41.020
Once I see it clearly

11:41.050 --> 11:42.050
and figure it out,

11:42.770 --> 11:43.380
I will

11:44.290 --> 11:46.290
stay here of my own free will.

11:53.040 --> 11:55.220
Come see me tomorrow
between 7 AM and 9 AM.

11:55.220 --> 11:56.220
Don't be late.

12:14.730 --> 12:17.010
This is the source of evil power?

12:17.810 --> 12:18.870
You could say that.

12:19.680 --> 12:21.540
Only this lies at its very bottom.

12:22.720 --> 12:24.250
It's the filth of this world

12:24.260 --> 12:26.780
that cannot be dissolved or dispersed.

12:27.810 --> 12:30.650
It breeds greed, malice,

12:31.560 --> 12:33.560
and the urge for self-destruction.

12:34.140 --> 12:36.140
Why does something like this exist?

12:36.770 --> 12:38.030
Where did it come from?

12:40.260 --> 12:42.320
Legend has it that Yin-Yang Crossing

12:42.390 --> 12:45.450
was formed from the eye of the earth
when Pangu split heaven and earth apart.

12:45.450 --> 12:46.420
Above ground,

12:46.450 --> 12:47.750
spiritual power gathers

12:47.750 --> 12:49.290
to nourish all living things.

12:49.290 --> 12:50.290
Below the ground,

12:50.530 --> 12:51.650
evil power surges endlessly,

12:51.650 --> 12:53.650
capable of destroying everything.

12:53.690 --> 12:54.400
That is why

12:55.050 --> 12:56.840
the land of Yin-Yang Crossing is fertile,

12:56.840 --> 12:58.320
and all beings gain sentience

12:58.320 --> 12:59.780
through spiritual power.

13:00.160 --> 13:03.160
But it can also be devoured
by evil power at any moment.

13:03.540 --> 13:04.540
This is the price.

13:06.960 --> 13:08.090
A hundred years ago,

13:09.100 --> 13:10.220
someone and I

13:13.300 --> 13:16.020
barely managed to seal it.

13:17.440 --> 13:18.710
If it's sealed,

13:19.180 --> 13:21.250
why does it keep leaking out?

13:22.020 --> 13:22.950
Look over there.

13:24.540 --> 13:26.660
A seal is like blocking a spring,

13:27.100 --> 13:29.560
while evil power
is like underground water.

13:30.050 --> 13:32.050
It will always find another way out.

13:32.610 --> 13:34.650
We call these seepages.

13:35.260 --> 13:36.970
There is no pattern

13:37.570 --> 13:39.350
to when or where they'll appear.

13:39.350 --> 13:41.430
What the Xiqianhua has been doing

13:41.900 --> 13:44.560
for the last century
was simply mending the land,

13:44.560 --> 13:47.360
suppressing evil power,
and purifying the earth.

13:48.440 --> 13:49.970
With your spiritual power?

13:51.500 --> 13:53.030
Spiritual power can drain,

13:53.450 --> 13:55.110
but the seepages never cease.

13:56.050 --> 13:58.640
I don't know how much longer
we can keep mending it.

13:58.640 --> 13:59.520
But recently,

14:00.880 --> 14:04.480
these seepages have begun appearing
with alarming regularity.

14:05.450 --> 14:06.930
Are you saying

14:07.900 --> 14:10.560
someone's deliberately
releasing evil power?

14:15.650 --> 14:16.450
What's wrong?

14:17.030 --> 14:19.030
Someone touched the seal. Get back!

14:39.880 --> 14:40.610
Lady Fufeng.

14:42.110 --> 14:42.900
Are you okay?

15:00.450 --> 15:01.300
What's this?

15:02.760 --> 15:05.760
Suppressing the corruption
with my spiritual power.

15:16.140 --> 15:16.930
Lady Fufeng.

15:41.690 --> 15:44.390
The corruption has invaded
her vital meridians.

15:44.390 --> 15:45.280
This time,

15:46.390 --> 15:48.500
I'm afraid she won't be able
to hold on much longer.

15:48.500 --> 15:49.670
What do you mean

15:50.100 --> 15:52.300
she won't be able to hold on much longer?

15:52.920 --> 15:53.980
Young Magistrate.

15:55.270 --> 15:55.840
My Lady.

15:57.770 --> 15:59.170
If I truly pass away,

16:00.530 --> 16:01.560
can you govern

16:03.850 --> 16:05.310
Yin-Yang Crossing for me?

16:05.310 --> 16:07.140
My Lady, you're a thousand-year-old demon.

16:07.140 --> 16:08.300
I'm just a...

16:10.950 --> 16:11.740
My Lady?

16:15.220 --> 16:16.020
Fengling.

16:16.230 --> 16:17.030
Come quickly.

16:18.950 --> 16:20.150
Check on Lady Fufeng.

16:20.250 --> 16:21.650
What's happening to her?

16:29.210 --> 16:30.340
A hundred years ago,

16:31.220 --> 16:33.030
Master gave half of her heart

16:33.290 --> 16:35.170
to her deputy at the time so they could

16:35.170 --> 16:36.900
suppress evil power together.

16:40.220 --> 16:41.340
Unexpectedly,

16:42.170 --> 16:44.500
that jerk broke his word and betrayed her.

16:45.290 --> 16:47.620
The moment he got Master's power, he fled.

16:48.620 --> 16:49.570
Half a heart?

16:51.090 --> 16:52.020
Over the years,

16:53.140 --> 16:56.530
Master has been pushing through
with only half a heart.

16:57.860 --> 17:00.520
While maintaining order
of Yin-Yang Crossing,

17:00.750 --> 17:03.410
she had to suppress
the corruption everywhere.

17:04.490 --> 17:07.020
Her spiritual power
has long been exhausted.

17:07.730 --> 17:09.390
And she has reached her limit.

17:09.760 --> 17:12.240
Then... how do we save her?

17:12.829 --> 17:13.619
Do you know

17:14.420 --> 17:17.500
why Master wanted you to stay?

17:18.490 --> 17:19.290
Why?

17:20.579 --> 17:22.510
Because whenever you're near her,

17:23.380 --> 17:26.060
her spiritual power recovers more quickly.

17:35.910 --> 17:37.330
Although you are a mortal,

17:37.330 --> 17:38.470
your physique is unique.

17:38.470 --> 17:40.450
You are highly compatible with Master.

17:40.450 --> 17:43.380
And you can help Master
restore her spiritual power.

17:44.170 --> 17:44.970
So that's why

17:45.930 --> 17:47.380
you asked me to stay—

17:48.490 --> 17:50.220
only for your spiritual power.

17:52.320 --> 17:53.350
I thought...

18:56.170 --> 18:56.650
My Lady.

19:01.930 --> 19:02.730
Didn't you say

19:03.380 --> 19:06.440
your spiritual power
recovers faster when I'm around?

19:06.620 --> 19:08.210
Just keep holding my hand.

19:11.970 --> 19:13.830
That won't be necessary anymore.

19:26.970 --> 19:29.620
All the records gathered
by Xiqianhua over the years

19:29.620 --> 19:31.880
are stored in the secret chamber behind.

19:32.380 --> 19:34.430
You''ll find methods
of suppressing corruption,

19:34.430 --> 19:36.160
records of land purification,

19:36.730 --> 19:37.970
civil cases,

19:39.170 --> 19:41.580
the traits of all kinds of demons,

19:42.010 --> 19:43.740
as well as how to regulate them.

19:54.410 --> 19:55.730
Didn't you want to know

19:56.470 --> 20:00.130
how to govern Yin-Yang Crossing
where humans and demons coexist?

20:01.590 --> 20:03.050
Everything I can teach you

20:03.160 --> 20:03.980
is in there.

20:11.970 --> 20:13.570
Go back to your county yamen.

20:14.340 --> 20:15.140
From now on,

20:16.490 --> 20:18.260
unless it's official business,

20:18.260 --> 20:20.260
there's no need to come see me again.

20:20.970 --> 20:21.650
My Lady.

20:22.390 --> 20:23.280
What are you...

20:25.540 --> 20:26.490
Bai Shanjun,

20:27.840 --> 20:28.920
you are free now.

20:32.270 --> 20:32.820
My Lady.

20:34.540 --> 20:35.540
I promise you.

20:36.990 --> 20:37.990
I will stay.

20:58.560 --> 20:59.920
Well done.

21:02.860 --> 21:04.520
I can't extract a human heart.

21:05.110 --> 21:07.040
This is the best I can do to help you.

21:07.340 --> 21:09.140
Liu Fufeng's days are numbered.

21:09.770 --> 21:11.730
You can do whatever you want.

21:12.530 --> 21:14.130
Just don't look for me again.

21:15.860 --> 21:18.100
You can't extract a human heart?

21:19.530 --> 21:21.150
If you hadn't run away just now,

21:21.150 --> 21:22.450
wouldn't you have already succeeded?

21:22.450 --> 21:24.350
I wasn't thinking straight at the moment!

21:24.350 --> 21:25.870
Since you are unwilling to take the heart,

21:25.870 --> 21:28.180
then give me all your spiritual power!

21:45.590 --> 21:46.390
Fufeng,

21:47.100 --> 21:48.790
we'll soon meet again.
